<-!------------------------------ 4.0 ------------------------------!->

Changes
    [*] Recoded into JS

<-!------------------------------ 4.1 ------------------------------!->

Additions
    [+] Added ESLint and Prettier for code quality and consistency.
    [+] Implemented a database system using better-sqlite3 to remember active channels.
    [+] The bot will now automatically rejoin its last active channel on startup.
    [+] Added a `data` directory for database storage.

Changes
    [*] Updated all outdated npm dependencies to their latest versions.
    [*] Refactored configuration from `config.json` to a more secure `.env` file.
    [*] Centralized all audio player logic into a new `utils/player.js` module for better maintainability.
    [*] Improved the logger to only write error stacks to a log file.

Fixes
    [!] Cleaned up console logs for a quieter startup process.

<-!------------------------------ 4.2 ------------------------------!->

Additions
    [+] Modularized event handling system under `src/events/` (ready and interactionCreate).
    [+] Added dedicated command deployment script under `scripts/deploy-commands.js`.
    [+] Added `npm start`, `npm run dev`, and `npm run deploy` package scripts.
    [+] Migrated ESLint to modern flat config format (`eslint.config.js`) supporting ESLint 9+.

Changes
    [*] Restructured project files into standard professional `src/` layout.
    [*] Updated package metadata and license descriptor to AGPL-3.0.
    [*] Standardized and documented all environment variables in `.env.example`.
    [*] Enhanced /help command embed with accurate command descriptions and icons.

Fixes
    [!] Fixed unused variable warnings and linter errors across all utility modules.
    [!] Removed obsolete orphaned hotfix scripts.

<-!------------------------------ 4.2.1 ------------------------------!->

Additions
    [+] Autonomous 24/7 Voice Watchdog supervisor (`src/utils/watchdog.js`) to continuously monitor and self-heal voice connections.
    [+] Exponential backoff reconnection queue for temporary Discord Voice outages (521/522 errors).
    [+] Global unhandled rejection and uncaught exception safety handlers.

Changes
    [*] Increased Discord client max EventEmitter listeners to 100 to eliminate shard listener leak warnings.
    [*] Improved voice disconnection lifecycle to cleanly reset state for watchdog recovery.

Fixes
    [!] Fixed permanent voice disconnection issue when Discord voice server outages exceed 30 seconds.
    [!] Prevented accidental database channel pruning caused by transient Discord API errors.

